h1. What is HashiCorp Vault?

HashiCorp Vault is a powerful secrets management platform that provides secure storage, dynamic credential generation, and comprehensive access control for modern cloud-native applications and infrastructure.

{panel:title=Core Vault Capabilities|borderStyle=solid|borderColor=#3498db|titleBGColor=#2980b9|titleColor=#ffffff}
h4. Secrets Management
• *Static Secrets:* Secure storage of API keys, passwords, certificates
• *Dynamic Secrets:* On-demand credential generation for databases and cloud providers
• *Encryption as a Service:* Application-level encryption without managing keys

h4. Authentication & Authorization
• *Multiple Auth Methods:* LDAP, OIDC, Kubernetes, Cloud provider authentication
• *Fine-grained Policies:* Path-based access control with conditions
• *Identity Management:* Centralized identity and group management

h4. Security Features
• *Zero Trust Architecture:* Never trust, always verify approach
• *Audit Logging:* Comprehensive audit trails for compliance
• *Secure Storage:* Encrypted at rest and in transit
• *High Availability:* Clustering and disaster recovery capabilities
{panel}

h1. Why Multi-Team Onboarding?

Organizations with multiple development teams face unique challenges in secret management, requiring isolation, governance, and scalability while maintaining security and operational efficiency.

{panel:title=Enterprise Challenges|borderStyle=solid|borderColor=#e74c3c|titleBGColor=#c0392b|titleColor=#ffffff}
h4. Security Challenges
• Static secrets sprawled across multiple systems
• Lack of secret rotation and lifecycle management
• Insufficient access controls and audit trails
• Manual secret distribution and updates

h4. Operational Challenges
• Team isolation and namespace management
• Consistent onboarding processes across teams
• Integration with existing CI/CD and Kubernetes workflows
• Scaling secret management across multiple environments

h4. Compliance Requirements
• Regulatory compliance (SOX, PCI, GDPR)
• Audit trail requirements and reporting
• Access review and governance processes
• Data residency and encryption requirements
{panel}

h1. Solution Architecture

Our multi-team Vault implementation provides complete isolation using HCP Vault namespaces mapped to Kubernetes namespaces, enabling secure and scalable secret management.

h2. High-Level Architecture

{noformat}
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    HCP Vault Cloud                             │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  admin/          │  platform/       │  team-alpha/    │ team-beta/ │
│  ├─ policies/    │  ├─ shared/      │  ├─ dev/        │ ├─ dev/    │
│  ├─ audit/       │  ├─ monitoring/  │  ├─ staging/    │ ├─ prod/   │
│  └─ governance/  │  └─ infra/       │  └─ prod/       │ └─ ...     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                    │
                          ┌─────────┴─────────┐
                          │   Kubernetes      │
                          │   Integration     │
                          └─────────┬─────────┘
                                    │
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Kubernetes Clusters                         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  team-alpha-dev  │  team-alpha-prod │  team-beta-dev │ platform  │
│  ├─ VaultAuth    │  ├─ VaultAuth    │ ├─ VaultAuth   │ ├─ Monitor │
│  ├─ StaticSecret │  ├─ StaticSecret │ ├─ DynamicSec  │ ├─ Logging │
│  └─ Applications │  └─ Applications │ └─ Apps        │ └─ Infra   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
{noformat}

h2. Key Architecture Benefits

{panel:title=Architecture Advantages|borderStyle=solid|borderColor=#27ae60|titleBGColor=#2ecc71|titleColor=#ffffff}
• *Complete Isolation:* Each team operates in their own Vault namespace
• *Kubernetes Native:* Seamless integration with Kubernetes workloads
• *Automated Onboarding:* Standardized team setup and configuration
• *Centralized Governance:* Platform-level control with team autonomy
• *Scalable Design:* Easy addition of new teams and environments
{panel}

h1. Implementation Guides

Navigate through our comprehensive guides to implement HashiCorp Vault for your organization. Each guide builds upon the previous ones, providing a complete implementation path.

