### [Keystore Management Guide|keystore-management-guide]

{panel:title=📚 Keystore Management with HashiCorp Vault|borderStyle=dashed|borderColor=#9b59b6}
*What you'll learn:*
• KV secrets engine setup and configuration
• Secret organization patterns and naming conventions  
• Access control policies for different environments
• Application integration with Python and Go examples
• Monitoring, auditing, and troubleshooting

*Prerequisites:* Basic Vault knowledge, admin access to Vault instance
*Time to complete:* 2-3 hours
*Difficulty:* Beginner to Intermediate

*Key Topics:*
• Enabling and configuring KV v2 secrets engine
• Designing logical namespace structures for teams
• Creating environment-specific access policies
• Secret versioning and lifecycle management
• Integration patterns for applications and CI/CD
{panel}

